        "content": "\n**Untested paths:**\n- `find_matches()` — span overlap deconfliction (`_append_if_free`)\n- `find_matches()` — regex patterns: `CLASSIFICATION_PATTERN`, `LANGUAGE_PROFILE_PATTERN`, `SECTION_REF_PATTERN`\n- `get_entity_type()` — regex fallback branch\n- Longer phrase takes priority over shorter when overlapping\n\n```python\n",
