        "title": "7. `OrchestratorAgent` — no tests at all",
        "content": "\n**Untested (all):**\n- `_build_synthesis_prompt()` includes agent findings and citations\n- `_aggregate_citations()` deduplicates by (title, url)\n- `_deterministic_grounding()` computes correct `coverage` field for full/partial/none\n- `_route()` fallback when LLM returns malformed JSON\n- `process()` fallback when JSON parse fails\n\n```python\n",
